#: ../../source/notebooks/17. Models.ipynb:9 Multi-Symbol
#: f85d4140ecd04f3188891e02458704ce
msgid "Multi-Symbol Models"
msgstr "多品种模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 3e807d86895542258dccebc41fcd1c62 Models.ipynb:11
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"The model training used so far has trained a separate instance for every "
"ticker symbol. Instead, a single model can be trained across symbols that"
" behave similarly, such as stocks in a specific industry."
msgstr "到目前为止，模型训练都是为每个股票代码单独训练一个实例。而现在，也可以在行为相似的品种（例如同一行业的股票）之间训练一个共享模型。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 70a0da30e271409e979779d495c7da84 Models.ipynb:13
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"**PyBroker v2** supports training one model across all symbols passed to "
"`Strategy.add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__,"
" as shown in this notebook."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker v2** 支持在传递给 `Strategy.add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" 的所有品种上训练同一个模型，本文档将对此进行演示。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 1ca6be12b00941a7be9b3bbbb2d83392 Models.ipynb:64
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid "Training One Model on Multiple Symbols"
msgstr "在多个品种上训练一个模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. Models.ipynb:66 Multi-Symbol
#: abe3eccabf0b4073b4f9e7d1a4f2a683
msgid ""
"This notebook repurposes the linear regression example from `Training a "
"Model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html>`__."
" Below, one shared `LinearRegression <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html>`__"
" model is trained with the `close_minus_ma "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.close_minus_ma>`__"
" indicator on four chip stocks:"
msgstr ""
"本文档复用了 `训练模型 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html>`__"
" 中的线性回归示例。下面将使用 `close_minus_ma "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.close_minus_ma>`__"
" 指标，在四只芯片股上训练一个共享的 `LinearRegression <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html>`__"
" 模型："

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. Models.ipynb:104 Multi-Symbol
#: aaa959c1972f49a2b34ba6d16f00f91d
msgid ""
"Registering the model with ``pooled=True`` will train it only once per "
"execution. This replaces the training function's single ``symbol`` "
"argument with a ``symbols`` tuple and passes the combined train and test "
"splits."
msgstr ""
"以 ``pooled=True`` 注册模型后，该模型在每次执行中只会训练一次。这会用一个 ``symbols`` 元组替换训练函数原本单一的 "
"``symbol`` 参数，并传入这些品种合并后的训练集和测试集划分。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 6c3974c92d714dc6bb8ace8f9daa18e8 Models.ipynb:106
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"During the backtest, the trained model is shared across all symbols in "
"the execution:"
msgstr "在回测过程中，已训练的模型会在该执行中的所有品种之间共享："

